ongly suspect these are the SMB \"Player\" variables plus \"Enemy\" variables where the player IS object 0 and enemies are objects 1-6 in the SAME arrays. So there's an ID array base somewhere, e.g. $000F? Let's check: $000F=1 (object 0 = player ID=1?) and $0010=0 (object 1 = enemy ID=0 = Go","truncated":true}
